'''Nafaalilargus''' is a red [[Lore:Dragon|dragon]] serving the [[Redguard:Empire|Empire]] as a mercenary. He was instrumental in the defeat of [[Redguard:A'tor|Prince A'tor]] at the [[Lore:Battle of Stros M'Kai|Battle of Stros M'Kai]], his greatest feat being the fiery destruction of [[Redguard:A'tor's Flagship|A'tor's flagship]]. After the battle, he was rewarded with many dead soldiers to feast upon. The dragon now occupies [[Redguard:Amiel Richton|Richton]]'s [[Redguard:Treasure Vaults|Treasure Vaults]], which are connected to the [[Redguard:Catacombs|Catacombs]]. Richton has tasked him with guarding not only the treasure in the vault but also the [[Redguard:Soul Gem|soul gem]] containing A'tor's soul. He uses a [[Redguard:Treasure Vaults Exit|large door]] north of the [[Redguard:Palace|Palace]] to enter and exit.

When you meet Nafaalilargus in the treasury, the door you came in through shuts, and he begins speaking. The dragon is unwilling to give up the soul gem, so [[Redguard:Cyrus|Cyrus]] engages him in combat. Your sabre has no effect until heating it in the brazier nearby. His attacks are quite dangerous and cause 20 damage, but he sometimes has trouble hitting you.
