;[[Redguard:Recover the Soul Gem#Conversation with Nafaalilargus|Conversation with Nafaalilargus]]
:The dragon introduces himself, and tells [[Redguard:Cyrus|Cyrus]] he is not a pet but a proud soldier. Cyrus asks for the soul gem, even offering to bargain, and although Nafaalilargus goes along with the idea, Cyrus realizes it is futile and prepares to fight.

