==Notes==
* His name is spelled '''Nafalilargus''' (with one A) in the [[Redguard:Introduction|introduction]]'s narration subtitles. However, his name is spelled with two As in his own dialogue, [[Redguard:Nidal|Nidal]]'s dialogue, and in a comment for his dialogue flag in <code>SOUP386.DEF</code>. It is also spelled as '''N'falilaargas''' in ''[[Books:The Redguard Companion|The Redguard Companion]]''. All other supplementary materials and subsequent games spell it as Nafaalilargus.
* Nafaalilargus also appears in [[Online:Online|ESO]], under the [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon language]] name [[Online:Nahfahlaar|Nahfahlaar]].